//│ deforest > call +⁰@result⁴ @ <root> -> Pure
//│ deforest > call f1⁰@result⁶ @ <root> -> UnsafeEta
//│ deforest > call f2⁰@result³ @ <root> -> UnsafeEta
//│ deforest > call f2⁰@result⁵ @ <root> -> UnsafeEta
